{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 12,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        111.939697265625,
        340.1429443359375,
        150.1796875
      ],
      "text": "Executive summary",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        187.1798095703125,
        526.9020385742188,
        200.32481384277344
      ],
      "text": "It is estimated that about a quarter of the world’s population is infected with  Mycobacterium",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        202.6798095703125,
        526.9819946289062,
        215.82481384277344
      ],
      "text": "– the bacterium that causes tuberculosis (TB) disease. Testing for TB infection can  tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.1798095703125,
        526.9415283203125,
        231.32481384277344
      ],
      "text": "identify individuals who would benefit the most from TB preventive treatment (TPT). However,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.6798095703125,
        527.3240356445312,
        246.82481384277344
      ],
      "text": "despite the availability of preventive measures and disease treatment, TB remains a leading cause",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.926152229309082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        249.1798095703125,
        527.2384033203125,
        262.3248291015625
      ],
      "text": "of death due to a single infectious agent. TB has probably replaced coronavirus disease (COVID-19)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.895251274108887,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        264.6798095703125,
        524.4094848632812,
        277.8248291015625
      ],
      "text": "as the leading cause of death worldwide for the first time since the start of the global pandemic .  (1)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.890000343322754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        285.84912109375,
        524.4144897460938,
        298.994140625
      ],
      "text": "In recognition of the need to end TB globally, the United Nations (UN) held the world’s first high-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        301.34912109375,
        527.151123046875,
        314.494140625
      ],
      "text": "level meeting on TB in 2018. The political declaration from the meeting included commitments",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.974821090698242,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        316.84912109375,
        526.8425903320312,
        329.994140625
      ],
      "text": "by Member States to achieving four new global targets  , which were subsequently renewed  (2)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.987142562866211,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        332.34912109375,
        526.9590454101562,
        345.494140625
      ],
      "text": "at the second UN high-level meeting in 2023. The commitments included two that relied on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        347.84912109375,
        527.0250854492188,
        360.994140625
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis of TB infection and disease: providing TPT to at least 45 million people between",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.34912109375,
        527.0086669921875,
        376.494140625
      ],
      "text": "2024 and 2027, and reaching 90% of the estimated number of people who develop TB with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        378.84912109375,
        526.9510498046875,
        391.994140625
      ],
      "text": "quality-assured diagnosis and treatment from 2023 to 2027  . These commitments align  (2)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        394.34912109375,
        526.9656372070312,
        407.494140625
      ],
      "text": "with the World Health Organization’s (WHO’s) End TB Strategy, which calls for the detection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.84912109375,
        526.9039916992188,
        422.994140625
      ],
      "text": "of individuals living with TB infection who are at higher risk of progression to active TB so that",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.34912109375,
        526.989990234375,
        438.494140625
      ],
      "text": "they can receive TPT, as well as the early diagnosis of TB and drug-resistant TB (DR-TB) through",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.99174690246582,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.84912109375,
        526.9479370117188,
        453.994140625
      ],
      "text": "universal drug susceptibility testing (DST). These global commitments and plans highlight the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        456.34912109375,
        526.9259033203125,
        469.494140625
      ],
      "text": "critical role of TB testing for the rapid and accurate detection of TB infection, disease and drug",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.84912109375,
        137.76690673828125,
        484.994140625
      ],
      "text": "resistance  . (3)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        491.5184020996094,
        526.9642944335938,
        504.6634216308594
      ],
      "text": "To support countries in their efforts to strengthen detection of TB infection, disease and drug",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        505.5184326171875,
        527.1626586914062,
        518.6634521484375
      ],
      "text": "resistance, the WHO Global TB Programme issues evidence-based policy guidance on TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        519.5184326171875,
        527.0140380859375,
        532.6634521484375
      ],
      "text": "testing strategies and technologies; this guidance is routinely updated. Since the most recent",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.5184326171875,
        369.3464660644531,
        546.6634521484375
      ],
      "text": "consolidated guidelines on TB diagnosis were issued in 2024:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.6876220703125,
        78.70909881591797,
        567.8326416015625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.70909881591797,
        554.6876220703125,
        526.7994995117188,
        567.8326416015625
      ],
      "text": "new evidence has become available on the use of WHO-recommended rapid diagnostic tests",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.993297576904297,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        570.1876220703125,
        527.0858764648438,
        583.3326416015625
      ],
      "text": "(WRDs) for the initial detection of TB and resistance to rifampicin among populations that are",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.988393783569336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        585.6876220703125,
        524.44482421875,
        598.8326416015625
      ],
      "text": "at increased risk of TB-related morbidity and mortality (e.g. people living with HIV and children);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        601.1876220703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        614.3326416015625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        601.1876220703125,
        526.7676391601562,
        614.3326416015625
      ],
      "text": "a systematic assessment of evidence on molecular WRDs (mWRDs) previously recommended",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.95455551147461,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        616.6876220703125,
        527.2412719726562,
        629.8326416015625
      ],
      "text": "as individual products was completed to determine the placement of mWRDs within existing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.950438499450684,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        632.187744140625,
        325.96124267578125,
        645.332763671875
      ],
      "text": "or new classes of TB diagnostic technologies; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.687744140625,
        78.81909942626953,
        660.832763671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        647.687744140625,
        527.0081176757812,
        660.832763671875
      ],
      "text": "a call from countries was received to combine the policy guidance on TB infection, disease",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        663.187744140625,
        526.98876953125,
        676.332763671875
      ],
      "text": "and drug-resistance testing into these consolidated guidelines on TB diagnosis, to streamline",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.95269775390625,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        678.687744140625,
        325.23193359375,
        691.832763671875
      ],
      "text": "implementation of national testing programmes.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.5261840820312,
        527.01318359375,
        718.6712036132812
      ],
      "text": "In response, this document is being issued as the fourth edition of the consolidated guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996048927307129,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.0261840820312,
        527.0803833007812,
        734.1712036132812
      ],
      "text": "on TB diagnosis. When compared with the third edition (issued in 2024), this guideline is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        736.5261840820312,
        526.9645385742188,
        749.6712036132812
      ],
      "text": "the first to combine the WHO policy guidance on diagnosis of TB infection, disease and drug",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        752.0261840820312,
        526.5038452148438,
        765.1712036132812
      ],
      "text": "resistance into a single reference document; also, it establishes two new classes of TB diagnostic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.956262588500977,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        43.43040084838867,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "x WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}